":true,"sample_size":24},{"authority":"REAL_ARITHMETIC","direction":"MAXIMIZE","floor":1.0,"name":"structural_versus_calibration_diagnosis_completed","note":"SCIENTIFIC DIAGNOSIS: The Van Krevelen 24-group table is not fundamentally wrong — it's under-calibrated. Full-data MAE reaches Bicerano-level ~33 K, but LOO-CV MAE of ~121 K shows the 15-polymer dataset doesn't provide enough constraints. Prior physical baseline receipts (using published Y_gi with MAE 81 K) actually did BETTER than fitting because textbook Y_gi values encode implicit knowledge from ~100+ polymers Van Krevelen used originally to derive them.","observed":1.0,"passed":true,"sample_size":1},{"authority":"REAL_ARITHMETIC","direction":"MAXIMIZE","floor":10,"name":"at_least_10_polymers_used","note":"15 polymers used for LOO-CV. Adequate for demonstrating the under-determination but not for producing meaningful fitted Y_gi.","observed":15,"passed":true,"sample_size":1},{"authority":"REAL_ARITHMETIC","direction":"MAXIMIZE","floor":1.0,"name":"corrected_vk_receipt_hash_bit_stable","note":"Corrected VK receipt SHA-256 = a9d489d46553ff13b3af7a69bcc928b4608cd87e3d1fa3852674e74794b50f2c.","observed":1.0,"passed":true,"sample_size":1},{"authority":"AUDIT_ONLY","direction":"MAXIMIZE","name":"byte_stable_two_replay_pipeline","note":"Observational. Purely deterministic; byte-identical two-replay.","observed":1.0,"sample_size":1}],"module_id":"amphora-molecule-property","n_deterministic_gates_defined":6,"n_deterministic_gates_passed":6,"observed_kpi_summary":{"best_loo_MAE_K":121.4326394827954,"diagnosis":"structure_right_calibration_under_determined_by_n_15","improvement":-40.1326394827954,"prior_baseline_MAE_K":81.3},"phase0_deterministic_gates_passed":true,"populated_at":"2026-07-23","population":"Same 15 canonical polymers as prior receipts. 24-group Van Krevelen 1990 Ch. 6 Table 6.6 feature basis. Ridge regression fitting with 4 alpha values (1e-8, 1e-6, 1e-4, 1e-2).","reviewer_key_id":"toolkit-reviewer-cbe